<p><a href=\"#/3023779\">B1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3023782\">B1C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3023786\">B1D</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1e</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3023787\">B1E</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Recover the control unit</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004870.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the additional junction\nunit is not damaged.</p><p>Connect the lower electrical connections.</p><p>Position the control unit and attach it\nto the side retainers.</p><p>Connect the upper electrical connection.</p><p>Close the cover and attach the retainers.</p><p>Test the electrical system.</p>"],[16,63,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3025752\">7025A14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025751\">7025A12</a></p>"]]